\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Come, Holy Spirit, heavenly Dove,
\par With all Thy quickening powers;
\par Kindle a flame of sacred love
\par In these cold hearts of ours.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. In vain we tune our formal songs,
\par In vain we strive to rise;
\par Hosannas languish on our tongues
\par And our devotion dies.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. And shall we then for ever live
\par At this poor dying rate?
\par Our love so faint, so cold to Thee,
\par And Thine to us so great!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Come, Holy Spirit, heavenly Dove,
\par With all Thy quickening powers;
\par Come, shed abroad the Saviour's love,
\par And that shall kindle ours.\tab 
\par                             Amen.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

